{"seq":1,"slug":"supplier-quality-scorecard-ppm-fpy","title":"供应商质量记分卡与 PPM/FPY/OTD 度量模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/supplier-performance-feedback/supplier-quality-scorecard-ppm-fpy","wordCount":3416,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"供应商质量记分卡与-ppm-fpy-otd-度量模型\">供应商质量记分卡与 PPM/FPY/OTD 度量模型</h1><p>一家在深圳、越南、墨西哥三地做 3C 配件的跨境卖家，采购总监在季度评审会上被一组数字顶住了：越南厂 PPM 只有 180，另一家 PPM 是 2200，看起来差了一个数量级，于是采购倾向把订单往越南厂倾斜。质量经理当场反问：那 180 是按「到货抽检不合格数」算的，2200 是按「客户退货 + 售后换货」算的，两个分母不同、口径不同、连时间窗都不同——这组对比能不能进评分卡，本身就是个数学问题。供应商质量记分卡（supplier quality scorecard）要解决的，恰恰是这件事：把 PPM、FPY、OTD 这类指标从「一张张孤立的报表」变成一套<strong>口径统一、可比、可加权、可驱动决策</strong>的度量体系。它接在纠正措施闭环之后——<a href=\"../scar-8d-root-cause/scar-8d-framework-d1-d3\">8D 与根因分析</a> 解决单次事件，记分卡解决「这个供应商整体上是否在变好」，并把结论反馈给来料检验的检验严格度与订单分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-记分卡是一组有口径的指标加一条治理规则\">核心概念：记分卡是一组有口径的指标加一条治理规则</h2><p>先说清三个词在本章的定义，后面所有公式都建立在其上。</p>\n<p><strong>度量（metric）</strong> 是一个有分子、分母、时间窗、数据源四要素的比率或计数，例如「上季度、以 IQC 判定口径、按到货批计的 DPPM」。\n<strong>记分卡（scorecard）</strong> 是若干度量的加权合成 + 评级规则 + 后果规则（下单、加严、评审、淘汰）。\n<strong>供应商绩效反馈闭环（performance feedback loop）</strong> 是把记分卡结论变成对供应商和对内部流程的实际动作，并在下一个周期验证效果。</p>\n<p>记分卡失效通常不是指标算错，而是<strong>口径混用</strong>：质量指标用抽检口径、交付指标用承诺口径、成本指标用发票口径，三个口径各自成立却无法合成一张可比的分。所以设计的第一步不是选 KPI，而是定义每个指标的口径与数据源，并冻结下来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;IQC 检验记录&lt;br/&gt;批判定/缺陷 code&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;质量度量&lt;br/&gt;DPPM / FPY / SCAR 时效&quot;]&#10;  B[&quot;收货与 ASN 数据&lt;br/&gt;EDI 856/SSCC&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;交付度量&lt;br/&gt;OTD / OTIF / 交期偏差&quot;]&#10;  C[&quot;售后与退货单&lt;br/&gt;RMA/换货&quot;] --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;加权合成&lt;br/&gt;S = Σ w_i · s_i&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;评级与分级&lt;br/&gt;A/B/C/D&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;后果规则&lt;br/&gt;订单分配/加严检验/评审/淘汰&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;下一周期复盘&lt;br/&gt;趋势与归因&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[\"IQC 检验记录&lt;br/&gt;批判定/缺陷 code\"] --&gt; D[\"质量度量&lt;br/&gt;DPPM / FPY / SCAR 时效\"]\n  B[\"收货与 ASN 数据&lt;br/&gt;EDI 856/SSCC\"] --&gt; E[\"交付度量&lt;br/&gt;OTD / OTIF / 交期偏差\"]\n  C[\"售后与退货单&lt;br/&gt;RMA/换货\"] --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; F[\"加权合成&lt;br/&gt;S = Σ w_i · s_i\"]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[\"评级与分级&lt;br/&gt;A/B/C/D\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"后果规则&lt;br/&gt;订单分配/加严检验/评审/淘汰\"]\n  H --&gt; I[\"下一周期复盘&lt;br/&gt;趋势与归因\"]\n  I --&gt; A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>分子 / 分母</th>\n<th>时间窗</th>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>主要陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DPPM</td>\n<td>不合格品数 / 收货总数 × 10⁶</td>\n<td>滚动 90 天</td>\n<td>IQC + 售后</td>\n<td>只算抽检口径，低估流出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FPY</td>\n<td>一次通过数 / 投入数</td>\n<td>按批次/月</td>\n<td>产线 MES 或供应商报数</td>\n<td>返工后计入通过，虚高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTY</td>\n<td>各工序 FPY 连乘</td>\n<td>按订单</td>\n<td>多工序汇总</td>\n<td>忽略工序间在制品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OTD</td>\n<td>准时到货次数 / 总到货次数</td>\n<td>按订单行</td>\n<td>收货系统</td>\n<td>「准时」如何定义未冻结</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OTIF</td>\n<td>准时且足量到货 / 总到货</td>\n<td>按订单行</td>\n<td>收货系统</td>\n<td>部分到货被算作准时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SCAR 时效</td>\n<td>按期关闭 SCAR 数 / 发出数</td>\n<td>滚动 6 月</td>\n<td>纠正措施系统</td>\n<td>关闭率代替有效性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ppm-与-dppm-缺陷率口径的三种算错方式\">PPM 与 DPPM：缺陷率口径的三种算错方式</h2><p>百万分之不良（Parts Per Million, PPM）的定义极简：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PPM</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>不合格</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>总数</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PPM} = \\frac{N_{\\text{不合格}}}{N_{\\text{总数}}} \\times 10^{6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PPM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">不合格</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>问题从来不在公式，而在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>不合格</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{不合格}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">不合格</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>总数</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{总数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的口径。跨境场景里至少要区分三种口径：</p>\n<p><strong>来料口径（incoming PPM / IQC PPM）</strong>：分母是 IQC 实收数量，分子是 IQC 判出的不合格数。它反映供应商出厂质量，但因抽样只能覆盖样本，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 方案允许少量缺陷流入，会系统性低估真实不良。若抽样方案来自 ISO 2859-1（国标等同 GB/T 2828.1），一个按 AQL 2.5 接收的批，其真实缺陷率可能远高于 2.5%——这正是<a href=\"../quality-incident-detection-triage/incoming-inspection-defect-classification\">来料检验与缺陷分级</a>里 OC 曲线讨论的推论。</p>\n<p><strong>流出口径（DPPM, Defective Parts Per Million）</strong>：分子改成客户端/售后被判定为不良的数量，包含客户退货、换货、投诉确认的不良。它才反映「客户实际感受到的不良」，是记分卡里最该被重罚的项，但它滞后数周、且受客户主观影响，样本量小。</p>\n<p><strong>制程口径（process PPM）</strong>：由供应商在自己的产线上报，通常配合 FPY。它的可信度取决于审计与现场验证，跨境场景中常需要第三方（SGS、Bureau Veritas、Intertek、QIMA）现场核验。</p>\n<p>三种口径的数值往往差 5–20 倍，混用就会得到文章开头那个假对比。正确做法是<strong>分别记录、分别设阈值、在记分卡里各占一格</strong>，而不是合并成一个「PPM」。</p>\n<p>还有一个常被忽略的换算陷阱：PPM 与过程能力的映射关系是非线性的。经典六西格玛换算中，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 对应约 66,807 DPPM、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 4\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 约 6,210 DPPM、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 6\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>（含 1.5σ 漂移）为 3.4 DPPM。把「PPM 降一半」当成「能力提升一半」是错的——低 PPM 区间每降一个数量级，需要的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 提升远大于线性直觉。这也解释了为什么对供应商提「从 500 PPM 降到 50 PPM」往往需要工艺级变更，而非加强检验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fpy-与-rty-一次通过率与全线良率的区别\">FPY 与 RTY：一次通过率与全线良率的区别</h2><p>一次通过率（First Pass Yield, FPY）度量「不做返工、不做返修、第一次就通过」的比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FPY</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>一次通过</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>投入</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FPY} = \\frac{N_{\\text{一次通过}}}{N_{\\text{投入}}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FPY</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">投入</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">一次通过</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的价值在于<strong>把返工成本显性化</strong>。一个产线若 FPY 只有 92%，意味着 8% 的产出经过了返工，返工消耗工时、耗材、且有二次损伤与漏检风险——这些成本在「最终合格率 99%」的口径下完全消失。所以供应商报良率时若只报最终合格率，应要求其补报 FPY。</p>\n<p>多工序场景要把各工序 FPY 连乘，得到滚动产出率（Rolled Throughput Yield, RTY）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RTY</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mtext>FPY</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RTY} = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} \\text{FPY}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTY</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FPY</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>举例：三个工序 FPY 分别为 0.95、0.93、0.97，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RTY</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0.95</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.93</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.97</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.857</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RTY} = 0.95 \\times 0.93 \\times 0.97 \\approx 0.857</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTY</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.93</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.97</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.857</span></span></span></span></span>，即全线一次通过率约 85.7%，尽管每一步看起来都「还行」。RTY 是把「每个工序都只坏一点点」的累积效应暴露出来的指标，也是跨境 OEM 订单里判断供应商是否真有工程能力的关键证据。</p>\n<p>记分卡里 FPY/RTY 的用法要注意两点。其一，<strong>报数方必须是可验证的</strong>：供应商自报的 FPY 若无 MES 记录或出货检验（OQC）抽样佐证，应标记为「未验证」而非直接采信。其二，FPY 的改善要区分「真改善」与「标准放宽」：把判定基准从 0.05 mm 放到 0.10 mm 能让 FPY 跳升，但那是把缺陷转嫁给客户端，必须与 DPPM 一起看，两个指标一升一降才是危险信号。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>FPY 表现</th>\n<th>DPPM 表现</th>\n<th>真实含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工程改善</td>\n<td>上升</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n<td>真改善</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判定基准放宽</td>\n<td>上升</td>\n<td>上升或持平</td>\n<td>缺陷转移，危险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返工计入通过</td>\n<td>虚高</td>\n<td>持平</td>\n<td>口径造假，需审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出货前全检加严</td>\n<td>持平</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n<td>末端拦截，非根因解决</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"otd-与交付绩效-先冻结-准时-的定义\">OTD 与交付绩效：先冻结「准时」的定义</h2><p>准时交付率（On-Time Delivery, OTD）是记分卡里最常被「各说各话」的指标，因为它取决于三个未冻结的定义：以谁的时间为准、以什么颗粒度算、允许多少偏差。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>OTD</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>准时到货</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>总到货次数</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{OTD} = \\frac{N_{\\text{准时到货}}}{N_{\\text{总到货次数}}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OTD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总到货次数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">准时到货</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>跨境场景的「准时」至少有三套基准：<strong>合同承诺交期（promised date）</strong>、<strong>采购订单要求交期（requested date）</strong>、<strong>生产计划需求日（need-by date）</strong>。供应商倾向用最宽松的承诺交期，采购倾向用最紧的需求日，两者能差出十几个百分点。正确做法是在采购协议里<strong>指定唯一基准</strong>并写入系统字段，例如「以 PO 上的 requested date 为基准，到货日以承运人 POD 或海外仓收货时间为准」。</p>\n<p>颗粒度同样要冻结：按订单行（PO line）、按 ASN 装运单元、还是按批次？全量足额交付率（On-Time In-Full, OTIF）通常更严格，因为它同时要求准时与足量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>OTIF</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>准时且足量</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>总订单行</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{OTIF} = \\frac{N_{\\text{准时且足量}}}{N_{\\text{总订单行}}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OTIF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总订单行</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">准时且足量</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母按「订单行」而非「订单」是关键：一个 PO 里 10 个 SKU 只到 9 个，按订单算可能仍是「准时」，按订单行算就暴露了缺货。跨境电商的补货周期长、波动大，OTIF 比 OTD 更能反映「供应商是否让我的库存计划可执行」。</p>\n<p>延迟的代价是可量化的：延迟导致的缺货损失、加急运费（空运替代海运）、海外仓滞留费，都可以折算成赔付或订单分配调整的依据。行业实践里常用的交期偏差分档是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span></span></span></span></span> 0 到 3 天为「准时」，4–7 天为「轻微延迟」，超过 7 天为「严重延迟」（阈值须按品类与运输方式协商冻结，不能照抄）。另外要区分<strong>供应商责任延迟</strong>与<strong>承运/清关责任延迟</strong>——把港口拥堵算在供应商头上，会让记分卡失去公信力，供应商也会开始「对策性报数」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"记分卡合成-加权-归一化与评级治理\">记分卡合成：加权、归一化与评级治理</h2><p>有了各自口径的指标，下一步是把它们合成一个可比的分。最基础的形式是线性加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i \\cdot s_i, \\quad \\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i = 1, \\quad 0 \\le s_i \\le 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个指标的归一化得分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是权重。归一化最稳妥的做法是<strong>区间映射</strong>而非线性缩放，因为「PPM 从 100 到 50」和「从 5000 到 4950」的价值完全不同：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>并截断到 </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 100 \\times \\frac{t - x}{t - f}, \\quad \\text{并截断到 } [0, 100]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1725em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">并截断到</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是目标值（target，得 100 分），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是地板值（floor，得 0 分），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 是实际值。对「越小越好」的指标（PPM、延迟天数）用上式；对「越大越好」的指标（FPY、OTD）把分子分母对调。</p>\n<p>权重不是拍脑袋，而是<strong>按失效后果分配</strong>。消费电子安全件（电池、充电器）的质量权重要显著高于外观件；海运补货的交付权重可以低于空运急单。一个可辩护的默认结构是把质量（DPPM + FPY + SCAR 有效性）放到 50%–60%，交付（OTD/OTIF）放到 25%–35%，剩余给响应速度与合作条款（如 CoA 及时性、变更通知）。权重必须<strong>事先公布并冻结一个考核周期</strong>，否则供应商会认为规则是事后为压低它而改的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>常见权重带</th>\n<th>代表指标</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来料与流出质量</td>\n<td>50%–60%</td>\n<td>incoming PPM、DPPM、FPY/RTY</td>\n<td>IQC、售后、MES</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纠正措施有效性</td>\n<td>含在上项或单列 10%–15%</td>\n<td>SCAR 按期关闭率、复发率</td>\n<td>纠正措施系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交付</td>\n<td>25%–35%</td>\n<td>OTD、OTIF、交期偏差</td>\n<td>收货系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应与合作</td>\n<td>5%–15%</td>\n<td>询价响应、变更通知、CoA 完整性</td>\n<td>采购/质量台账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>评级通常落在 A/B/C/D 四档，映射到不同的<strong>后果规则</strong>：A 级可获订单增量与放宽检验（跳批检验），B 级维持，C 级进入改善计划并加严检验，D 级进入淘汰或转移订单流程。这套「评级 → 后果」的绑定必须真的执行——记分卡若只评分不动作，供应商很快会学会无视它。IATF 16949:2016 第 8.4.2.4 条要求组织对供应商绩效做监控并保留证据，AIAG 的 CQI-19《次级供应商管理过程指南》则给出了把供应商分级与开发动作串起来的框架，可作治理设计的参照。</p>\n<p>治理上还要有一条<strong>争议与申诉通道</strong>：供应商应能看到构成自己得分的原始记录（哪批、哪个缺陷 code、哪次延迟），并在约定时限内提出异议。争议率本身也是健康度指标：零争议往往说明供应商放弃了沟通，而非数据无懈可击。这与<a href=\"../quality-incident-detection-triage/multi-source-signal-severity-triage\">多源信号与严重度分级</a>里「信号优先级」的逻辑一致——记分卡是长期趋势信号，单次争议是短期事件信号，两者要能互相解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>记分卡的核心不是选 KPI，而是<strong>冻结每个指标的口径、时间窗、数据源</strong>，再合成；口径混用会产出看似精确却不可比的假对比。</li>\n<li>PPM 至少要分<strong>来料 / 流出 / 制程</strong>三种口径分别记录；PPM 与过程能力是<strong>非线性</strong>映射，低 PPM 区间每降一个数量级都需要工艺级投入。</li>\n<li>FPY 暴露<strong>返工成本</strong>，RTY 暴露<strong>多工序累积损失</strong>；FPY 上升要结合 DPPM 一起看，才能区分「真改善」与「标准放宽」。</li>\n<li>OTD 的成败在于<strong>冻结「准时」的定义与颗粒度</strong>；OTIF 按订单行计更能暴露缺货，且要区分供应商责任与承运/清关责任。</li>\n<li>合成用<strong>区间归一化 + 后果导向权重</strong>（质量 50%–60%、交付 25%–35%），权重事前冻结；评级必须真的绑定加严、增量、淘汰等后果。</li>\n<li>记分卡要配<strong>争议申诉通道</strong>，并接受验证：供应商自报的 FPY 需要 MES 或 OQC 佐证，必要时由第三方现场核验。</li>\n<li>记分卡的结论回流到两个上游环节——驱动<a href=\"../quality-incident-detection-triage/incoming-inspection-defect-classification\">来料检验</a>的检验严格度调整，以及决定是否对同一供应商再发 <a href=\"../scar-8d-root-cause/scar-8d-framework-d1-d3\">SCAR 与 8D</a>；单次事件靠 8D 闭环，长期能力靠记分卡跟踪，二者缺一不可。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"供应商质量记分卡与 PPM/FPY/OTD 度量模型","id":"供应商质量记分卡与-ppm-fpy-otd-度量模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：记分卡是一组有口径的指标加一条治理规则","id":"核心概念-记分卡是一组有口径的指标加一条治理规则"},{"level":2,"text":"PPM 与 DPPM：缺陷率口径的三种算错方式","id":"ppm-与-dppm-缺陷率口径的三种算错方式"},{"level":2,"text":"FPY 与 RTY：一次通过率与全线良率的区别","id":"fpy-与-rty-一次通过率与全线良率的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"OTD 与交付绩效：先冻结「准时」的定义","id":"otd-与交付绩效-先冻结-准时-的定义"},{"level":2,"text":"记分卡合成：加权、归一化与评级治理","id":"记分卡合成-加权-归一化与评级治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"纠正措施 CAPA 有效性验证与逃逸复盘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/scar-8d-root-cause/capa-d5-d7-verification-escape"},"next":{"title":"供应商分级、AVL 准入与资格维持机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/supplier-performance-feedback/supplier-tiering-avl-qualification"}}